<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0"/>
  <title>Huddle - Build Your Community</title>
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="style.css" />
</head>
<body>
  <header>
    <div class="container nav">
      <img src="images/logo.svg" alt="Huddle Logo" class="logo" />
      <a href="#" class="btn btn-outline">Try It Free</a>
    </div>
  </header>

  <section class="hero container">
    <div class="hero-text">
      <h1>Build The Community<br>Your Fans Will Love</h1>
      <p>
        Huddle re-imagines the way we build communities. You have a voice, but so does your audience. 
        Create connections with your users as you engage in genuine discussion.
      </p>
      <a href="#" class="btn">Get Started For Free</a>
    </div>
    <div class="hero-image">
      <img src="images/illustration-mockups.svg" alt="Mockups" />
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="features">
    <div class="feature container">
      <img src="images/illustration-grow-together.svg" alt="Grow Together" />
      <div>
        <h2>Grow Together</h2>
        <p>Generate meaningful discussions with your audience and build a strong, loyal community.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="feature container reverse">
      <img src="images/illustration-flowing-conversation.svg" alt="Flowing Conversations" />
      <div>
        <h2>Flowing Conversations</h2>
        <p>You wouldn’t paginate a conversation in real life, so why do it online?</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="feature container">
      <img src="images/illustration-your-users.svg" alt="Your Users" />
      <div>
        <h2>Your Users</h2>
        <p>Once signed in to your app, users can start chatting immediately.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="cta container">
    <h2>Ready To Build Your Community?</h2>
    <a href="#" class="btn">Get Started For Free</a>
  </section>

  <footer>
    <div class="container footer">
      <div class="footer-col">
        <img src="images/logo.svg" alt="Huddle Logo" class="logo" />
        <p>Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipiscing elit.</p>
        <p>Phone: +1-543-123-4567</p>
        <p>Email: example@huddle.com</p>
      </div>
      <div class="footer-col">
        <a href="#">About Us</a>
        <a href="#">What We Do</a>
        <a href="#">FAQ</a>
      </div>
      <div class="footer-col">
        <a href="#">Career</a>
        <a href="#">Blog</a>
        <a href="#">Contact Us</a>
      </div>
    </div>
    <p class="copyright">© Copyright 2025 Huddle. All rights reserved.</p>
  </footer>
</body>
</html>
:root {
  --pink: #ff52bf;
  --light-pink: #ff8fd8;
  --dark-blue: #00252e;
  --gray-blue: #808d99;
  --bg: #f5faff;
  --white: #ffffff;
}

* {
  box-sizing: border-box;
  margin: 0;
  padding: 0;
}

body {
  font-family: 'Segoe UI', sans-serif;
  background-color: var(--bg);
  color: var(--dark-blue);
  line-height: 1.6;
}

.container {
  max-width: 1100px;
  margin: auto;
  padding: 2rem;
}

header {
  background-color: var(--bg);
  padding: 1rem 0;
}

.nav {
  display: flex;
  justify-content: space-between;
  align-items: center;
}

.logo {
  width: 120px;
}

.btn {
  background-color: var(--pink);
  color: var(--white);
  padding: 0.8rem 1.6rem;
  border: none;
  border-radius: 30px;
  font-weight: bold;
  text-decoration: none;
  transition: background 0.3s ease;
}

.btn:hover {
  background-color: var(--light-pink);
}

.btn-outline {
  background: transparent;
  border: 2px solid var(--pink);
  color: var(--pink);
}

.hero {
  display: flex;
  flex-wrap: wrap;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 3rem;
  margin-top: 2rem;
}

.hero-text {
  flex: 1;
}

.hero-text h1 {
  font-size: 2.5rem;
  margin-bottom: 1rem;
}

.hero-image img {
  width: 100%;
  max-width: 500px;
}

.features {
  background-color: var(--white);
  padding: 4rem 0;
}

.feature {
  display: flex;
  flex-wrap: wrap;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 2rem;
  margin-bottom: 4rem;
}

.feature.reverse {
  flex-direction: row-reverse;
}

.feature img {
  width: 100%;
  max-width: 400px;
}

.feature h2 {
  font-size: 1.8rem;
  margin-bottom: 1rem;
}

.cta {
  text-align: center;
  background-color: var(--white);
  padding: 3rem 1rem;
  border-radius: 15px;
  box-shadow: 0 0 15px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);
  margin: 4rem auto;
}

footer {
  background-color: var(--dark-blue);
  color: var(--white);
  padding: 3rem 1rem 1rem;
}

.footer {
  display: flex;
  flex-wrap: wrap;
  gap: 2rem;
  justify-content: space-between;
}

.footer-col {
  flex: 1 1 200px;
}

.footer-col a {
  display: block;
  color: var(--white);
  margin-bottom: 0.8rem;
  text-decoration: none;
}

.footer-col a:hover {
  text-decoration: underline;
}

.footer .logo {
  margin-bottom: 1rem;
  width: 120px;
}

footer p {
  margin-top: 1rem;
}

.copyright {
  text-align: center;
  font-size: 0.9rem;
  margin-top: 2rem;
  opacity: 0.6;
}
